          "request": {
            "name": "BigCommerce Create a Blog Post",
            "description": {
              "content": "Creates a *Blog Post*.\n\n**Required Fields**\n*   `title`\n*   `body`\n\n**Notes**\n\n* When including `published_date` in a request, supply it as a flat date string (not an object) in valid <a href=\"http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2822#section-3.3\" target=\"_blank\">RFC 2822</a>. The following example request includes a `published_date` in RFC 2822 format.\n* Blog posts default to draft status. To publish blog posts to the storefront, set the `is_published` property to `true`.\n* If a custom URL is not provided, the post’s URL will be generated based on the value of `title`.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "blog",
                "posts"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
